{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 2, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "卻", "id": "卻"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "召", "id": "召"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "招", "id": "招"}, {"form": "敢", "id": "敢"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "辭", "id": "辭"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.0339390783256746, "source": "見", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.1770399219663479, "source": "見", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 1.7960791303725714, "source": "見", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1770399219663479, "source": "見", "target": "諸"}, {"weight": 0.4838927414064026, "source": "見", "target": "敢"}, {"weight": 1.9502298101998297, "source": "見", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 0.7462570058738937, "source": "見", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.8256985475537295, "source": "見", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 0.659245628884264, "source": "養", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.0900285449767182, "source": "養", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 1.0900285449767182, "source": "養", "target": "敢"}, {"weight": 2.0455399900041544, "source": "養", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 0.946927701336045, "source": "養", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.26274880579855, "source": "敢", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 1.2723501017706729, "source": "敢", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 0.5792029212107276, "source": "敢", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.2723501017706729, "source": "敢", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 0.3168386567432364, "source": "敢", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 0.3168386567432364, "source": "敢", "target": "諸"